# Draft (machine-assisted) - needs native review
#: config/elnino.py:741
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For each cell, the fraction of the 51 members below the 33rd percentile (drier third) and above "
"the 67th (wetter third). With terciles, 33% is the no-information baseline."
msgstr ""
"Для каждой ячейки — доля из 51 члена ниже 33-го процентиля (самая сухая треть) и выше 67-го "
